    {
     "x": 0.44,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.48,
     "height": 0.24
    }
   ],
   "line": "“Hope” is the thing with feathers – / That perches in the soul – / And sings the tune without the words – / And never stops – at all –"
  },
  {
   "id": "sweetest-in-the-gale",
   "image": "02-sweetest-in-the-gale.png",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.45,
    "y": 0.3
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1000,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.48,
     "y": 0.42,
     "width": 0.44,
     "height": 0.2
    }
   ],
   "line": "And sweetest – in the Gale – is heard – / And sore must be the storm – / That could abash the little Bird / That kept so many warm –"
  },
  {
   "id": "chillest-land",
   "image": "03-chillest-land.png",
   "lines": 2,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.35,
    "y": 0.25
   },
   "textPreset": "ridge-reveal",
   "transitionMs": 1100,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.46,
     "y": 0.08,
     "width": 0.46,
     "height": 0.22
    }
   ],
   "line": "I’ve heard it in the chillest land – / And on the strangest Sea –"
  },
  {
   "id": "strangest-sea",
   "image": "04-strangest-sea.png",
   "lines": 2,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.55,
    "y": 0.45
   },
   "textPreset": "farewell-drift",
   "transitionMs": 1250,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.46,
     "y": 0.07,
     "width": 0.46,
     "height": 0.22
    }
   ],
   "line": "Yet – never – in Extremity, / It asked a crumb – of me."
  }
 ]
}